3.你过上了他渴望却得不到的生活\n4. 发现无法超越你，所以心生嫉妒\n5. 无法找到你毛病，所以心生不满\n6. 想要你去低头讨好，但又说不出来\n7. 你的出现，对他产生危机感","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2086098489809985737"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-08-08T13:48:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086087029914477005"],"id":"2086087029914477005","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":233,"impression_count":229039,"like_count":1756,"quote_count":19,"reply_count":271,"retweet_count":45},"text":"心理学家说过：\n\n18到28岁，是人对感情需求最强烈的时期\n\n如果你能在这段时间里一直保持单身，并且真正克服了孤独感\n\n那基本上，这辈子你都不需要谈恋爱了","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2086087029914477005"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-08-08T13:16:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086078976825684058"],"id":"2086078976825684058","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":24538,"like_count":527,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":52,"retweet_count":11},"text":"世界上不能没有布鲁斯\n\n就像西方不能没有耶路撒冷 https://t.co/52ZxPIeXt7","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2086078976825684058"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-08-08T12:39:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086069665655087396"],"id":"2086069665655087396","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9483,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":1},"text":"头像暴露了 https://t.co/bbqvpoTYFV","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2086069665655087396"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-08-08T11:33:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086053159198441872"],"id":"2086053159198441872","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":305783,"like_count":1773,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":384,"retweet_count":17},"text":"上学的时候\n\n老师嫌我话多\n\n把一个自闭症女孩给我当同桌\n\n一个月她开口骂了我十几次","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2086053159198441872"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-08-08T10:31:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086037453526192439"],"id":"2086037453526192439","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":25755,"lik